# Say Its Name: "If you search your library this way, shuffle." Bot1 chooses to search the library, with an Altanak, the Thrice-Called in the hand and another in the library.
# "A card named" is one card: the hand's goes onto the battlefield untapped and the library's stays, and the library is shuffled (CR 701.24), counted by Shuffles.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
